### order a domain certificate
POST http://localhost:8082/api/acm/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domain": "wwwx.asrevo.com",
  "reference": "1"
}

### validate a domain challenge
POST http://localhost:8082/api/acm/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": "https://acme-v02.api.letsencrypt.org/acme/order/593265476/200956001666"
}


### generate a domain challenge
POST http://localhost:8082/api/acm/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": "https://acme-v02.api.letsencrypt.org/acme/order/593265476/200956001666"
}
